  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electron, travelling at a constant upwards velocity, enters an area of perpendicularly oriented electric and magnetic fields. Magnetic field <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> is pointing into the page and electric field <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> is pointing vertically upwards.</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n<p>What is a possible direction of the resultant force on the electron the instant it enters the fields?</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Option A is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"B\">Option B is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"C\">Option C is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"D\">Option D is shown in the figure above.</li></ol>"
